Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; Wrap the quoted text at 71 characters instead of 75.
; Only needed if colored replies are sent as HTML mail (COLORIZER_HTML_RECIPIENTS or SendWithColors)
; to people who read mails as plain text: Outlook makes the plain text alternative of an HTML mail
; itself and wraps lines longer than 71 characters anew, which breaks the quotes.
[HKEY_CURRENT_USER\Software\VB and VBA Program Settings\QuoteFixMacro\Config]
"LINE_WRAP_AFTER"="71"
